          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"GoodFilmHunting #5\",\"description\":\"<p>Goodfilm Hunting #5<br><br>Quick recap for the newcomers: we are Goodfilm Hunting, a London-based film club started by 3 friends, on a mission to build a community around cinema. <br><br>We get it, life gets busy, and a 3-hour pretentious film in a language you can’t speak without any English subs or even sound for that matter isn’t always what the evening calls for. So we’ve done the curation for you: a series of 90-minute bangers (give or take), films you might not have caught before, ones that spark great conversations and might just inspire you to venture deeper into cinema. <br><br>This time round we’re moving our asses to the mystical Pedaller’s Corner in Stoke Newington for a special summery Spanish edition. <br><br>Tickets are limited, so grab yours and share with your people: friends, family, colleagues, bingo partners, whoever. <br><br>Love, Monty, Tom and Hugo</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-08T10:48:26.217\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"08b3f4f7-0117-4825-a4c9-14bd75730b1f\",\"address\":\"129-131 Stoke Newington Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Pedaller's Corner - Cafe\",\"latitude\":51.5562012,\"longitude\":-0.07475989999999999}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T23:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1%2F6b085b9a-b7ad-46c6-a3ba-04b89c2046ea%2F3b34e96d-e5d8-4bee-a670-9f99f3afa470.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"c62e9d5f-66de-4866-8d3f-f728839dc306\",\"name\":\"GoodFilmHunting\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fc62e9d5f-66de-4866-8d3f-f728839dc306%2F3082bc0d-1036-4bfa-b53c-5da7c740cbfc.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"goodfilmhunting-5\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":11,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":10,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":30,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema London\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Coffeehouse Cinema is coming to London.</strong></p><p>Join us for an evening of great movies, meaningful conversation, and connection with filmmakers and fellow film lovers.</p><p>Coffeehouse Cinema is built around a simple idea: films are better when we experience them together. Every screening brings new stories, new filmmakers, and new people into the room, creating a space for discovery, conversation, and community.</p><p>For the first time, we’re bringing that experience to London.<br></p><p><strong>Curated short films. Watched together.</strong><br></p><p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><p>Come early, grab a drink, and settle in with fellow filmmakers and film lovers before the screening begins.<br></p><p>At 7:00 PM, we’ll kick off a curated program of short films selected by Coffeehouse Cinema. After the films, stick around for conversation with the filmmakers and the people behind the work.<br></p><p>The evening is designed to feel less like a traditional theater screening and more like gathering with a room full of people who genuinely love movies.<br></p><p><strong>Expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>A thoughtfully curated selection of short films</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Time to meet filmmakers, creatives, and fellow film lovers</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Conversation and filmmaker Q&amp;A following the screening</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>A relaxed atmosphere at Mason &amp; Fifth</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Plenty of time to hang out and connect before and after the films</strong></p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Come for the movies. Stay for the conversation.</strong><br></p><p><strong>Event Details</strong></p><p><strong>Wednesday, September 23rd</strong></p><p><strong>Mason &amp; Fifth, Westbourne Park</strong><br>11 Woodfield Road<br>London W9 2BA<br>United Kingdom</p><p></p><p><strong>Doors Open: 6:30 PM</strong><br><strong>Screening Begins: 7:00 PM</strong><br></p><p><strong>Tickets: £15</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T13:53:44.141\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"827f0518-4ccc-4d45-8967-9649c2fbffd2\",\"address\":\"11 Woodfield Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Mason & Fifth, Westbourne Park\",\"latitude\":51.52295969999999,\"longitude\":-0.1995926}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-23T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-23T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d%2F452aee7c-aae4-4f87-8061-05553ae9ca69%2F5de99053-2449-48e3-8692-c5f0c9d2208c.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933\",\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F55f5cb38-2302-4b1f-9e60-3f41e966f933%2Febe2c84e-5215-4636-b5e0-f0321652439c.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"coffeehouse-cinema-london\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":48,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":2,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"a97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"RTG PADEL TOURNAMENT\",\"description\":\"<p>RTG Padel is back with another competitive day on court, bringing together players for a full afternoon of competitive padel.<br></p><p>Expect competitive matches, a great atmosphere and the chance to battle it out for the <strong>£300 cash prize for the winning team</strong>.<br></p><p>📅 <strong>Saturday 10th October</strong><br>⏰ <strong>11:30am – 5:00pm</strong><br>📍 <strong>Power League Romford, RM7 7AY</strong><br>🎾 <strong>Level: Intermediate+</strong><br>💷 <strong>£45 per player</strong><br>🏆 <strong>£300 cash prize for the winning team</strong></p><p><strong>2nd and 3rd place prizes are still to be determined and will be announced ahead of the tournament.</strong><br></p><p>Whether you're looking to test yourself against new players, compete for the trophy or enjoy a proper day of competitive padel, this tournament is for you.<br></p><p><strong>Please note: Tickets are non-refundable.</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-11T19:06:18.936\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"e12673ef-f5c6-4462-a9c8-169d9a9abb9e\",\"address\":\"Eastern Avenue West, Romford RM7 7AY, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Power League Romford\",\"latitude\":51.5839789,\"longitude\":0.1684574}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-10T11:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-10T17:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fa97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd%2F5be8cdcc-1725-40f0-8f2b-892a7313c426%2F86db9679-cc5c-4656-8891-6413935ed815.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5\",\"name\":\"RTG Padel\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5%2Fa7d7602d-e4a7-464e-bdc2-64605be78c6a.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"rtg-padel-tournament\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":1,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"ec0edfd2-8df1-4ca2-b1fe-327d4e68f9cc\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Bookish Besties Pop Up Two!\",\"description\":\"<p>We're back and BIGGER than ever! Bookish Besties, if you're ready for a magical, bookish WEEK of our 'Passionate Reader' pop-up book shop - grab your space below!</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-02T20:24:34.164\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"bd4eead5-f18a-4738-b3f8-adf7def64553\",\"address\":\"24 Dirty Lane, London SE1 9PA, UK\",\"locationName\":null,\"latitude\":51.5057226,\"longitude\":-0.0919921}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T12:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fec0edfd2-8df1-4ca2-b1fe-327d4e68f9cc%2Ff8543697-dc24-4428-a79c-8a66bb77c425%2Fa6386ee0-dc61-4720-926d-3b82f10335ea.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"ed82e1de-d9b0-4307-a0a2-72e908b68aa8\",\"name\":\"Bookish Besties\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fed82e1de-d9b0-4307-a0a2-72e908b68aa8%2F30d1546b-037f-4cd7-9076-3063d433a2e0.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"bookish-besties-pop-up-two\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":13,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":651,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":1649,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"bcfda108-16d3-460d-bffe-a0caaed2823b\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Raqueta y Reggaeton: East London\",\"description\":\"<p>Raqueta comes back to East London!</p><p><br>Join us for our second event at the iconic Lee Valley Hockey &amp; Tennis Centre, where we will have our tennis, reggaeton and great vibes as always!</p><p><br>📅 Sunday September 27th</p><p>🕓 4:15PM – 5:45PM Tennis at Lee Valley (E20 3AD)</p><p>🕕 6:15PM - 10PM Social at Lord Napier Star (E9 5ER)</p><p><br>70 SPOTS AVAILABLE</p><p>🎶 Reggaeton vibes while you play</p><p>🎾 Social + high-energy tennis</p><p>🎾 Tennis drills + games led by coaches</p><p>🍻 Post-tennis social 6:15pm – 10pm at The Lord Napier Star (20 min walk away) where we will have our own bar rented for the social with more reggaeton!</p><p>🥳 All equipment provided!</p><p>🍊 Water and light snacks provided</p><p>🤝 All levels welcome</p><p><br>Important: no refunds unless the event is cancelled</p><p><br>We can’t wait to see you all back in East London 💚💚</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-14T16:32:23.311\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"aed24d2f-74f0-4400-b3e1-3e7e81b8d7e0\",\"address\":\"Leadmill Lane, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Lee valley hockey and tennis centre \",\"latitude\":51.5543254,\"longitude\":-0.0162437}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-27T16:15:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-27T22:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fbcfda108-16d3-460d-bffe-a0caaed2823b%2F78d9324d-bf11-414c-8177-79dd3942f6ab%2Fa03edb67-07ec-40f0-a187-7e0bd8cb3d1c.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"e07d7486-e17f-437a-9954-2fad0e512012\",\"name\":\"Raqueta y Reggaeton \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fe07d7486-e17f-437a-9954-2fad0e512012%2Fd6e0edfc-d8fc-44d1-b30e-039971138cb9.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"raqueta-y-reggaeton-east-london-3\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"new\",\"likedCount\":2,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":53,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":19,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"b51eb8f2-ab18-4a78-90cd-4dbc578093ef\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"TEXTS I NEVER SENT\",\"description\":\"<p>‘I love you’, ‘how dare you’ ‘I miss you’… these are ‘TEXTS I NEVER SENT’ Second Space is back with another thought provoking theme at GoHub Stuido on Thursday 24th September.<br><br>5 open mic artists chosen at random.<br>5 headliners.<br><br>DOORS AND OPEN MIC SIGN UPS: 6.30pm<br>SHOW STARTS: 7pm.<br><br>You dont wanna miss this one📲</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T15:25:10.169\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"33c504c2-9a62-49f9-b3b8-6d6abc0f3208\",\"address\":\"222 Brixton Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"GoHub Studio\",\"latitude\":51.4720993,\"longitude\":-0.1130211}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-24T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-24T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fb51eb8f2-ab18-4a78-90cd-4dbc578093ef%2F3147b0dc-4275-4a4f-842f-61e8438aa78a%2F76f253b6-c217-4787-a65b-a035349498c9.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b\",\"name\":\"SECOND SPACE.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b%2F5db93e84-59e9-4e6f-a52b-b6904d1e6178.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"texts-i-never-sent\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":4,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":54,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":6,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"8c31d3dc-25e8-41bd-b5ec-d62061b47dad\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"CHBC Weekly Session 17/09\",\"description\":\"<p>Come along to our weekly badminton session for a fun, friendly game and a chance to get active. Whether you're a complete beginner or you've been playing for years, everyone is welcome. It's all about enjoying the game, meeting new people, and having a good time.<br></p><p>Don't forget to bring a bottle of water, and if you have your own badminton racket, bring it along. If not, we've got rackets you can borrow.<br></p><p><strong>Playing till the shuttle drops...</strong><br></p><p><em>DISCLAIMER</em></p><p><u>The venue is a NUT-FREE zone, please could you NOT bring nuts or nut-based products into the venue in any form.</u><br></p><p>All our links: <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://linktr.ee/chbadmintonclub?utm_source=linktree_profile_share&amp;ltsid=3635795a-7f48-4ccb-a0f0-57c07a29c2bc\\\"><u>https://linktr.ee/chbadmintonclub?utm_source=linktree_profile_share&amp;ltsid=3635795a-7f48-4ccb-a0f0-57c07a29c2bc</u></a></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-28T11:27:06.429\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"ff835934-3e6b-45f4-8d8c-c9ce662d891d\",\"address\":\"Lambs Lane South, Rainham, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Harris Academy Rainham\",\"latitude\":51.5165879,\"longitude\":0.206678}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T20:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F8c31d3dc-25e8-41bd-b5ec-d62061b47dad%2F9b2c4bc0-4286-450f-9687-06b3390560ae%2F30ed9550-0af8-429d-8311-6de50cd43061.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"26e9ca66-9159-4df9-9e49-044f064ed603\",\"name\":\"C.H Badminton Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F26e9ca66-9159-4df9-9e49-044f064ed603%2Fbfa3d1fa-aea5-4bd2-892e-73e90d024f25.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"chbc-weekly-session-17-09\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":19,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":4,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"7a18a139-107c-42da-af7f-53e7e9e24cf6\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"The Spoken Room\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>The Spoken Room is a poetry workshop with a live band.</strong><br></p><p>We’ll start the evening with a guided writing session led by our poet facilitator, using prompts to help you slow down, reflect and put your thoughts into words.<br></p><p>Later in the night, anyone who wants to share can perform what they’ve written. Before you begin, you’ll tell the band the feeling or atmosphere you want behind your piece, and they’ll improvise around your words live.<br></p><p>You don’t need to be a poet, you don’t need to have anything prepared, and there’s absolutely no pressure to perform. You can come to write, listen, meet people and simply enjoy the room.<br></p><p>For this edition, we’re bringing The Spoken Room to <strong>Tower Bridge Collective</strong> as part of their program called <strong>Sounds of LDN</strong>.<br></p><p><strong>Sunday 27 September</strong><br><strong>Tower Bridge Collective</strong><br><strong>7PM to 10:30PM</strong><br></p><p>Come with an open mind. We’ll take care of the rest.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-31T15:20:32.622\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"946ff86f-1250-4fbf-b025-4b8b39d94c00\",\"address\":\"1 Shad Thames, Horselydown Lane, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"The Tower Bridge Collective\",\"latitude\":51.504017,\"longitude\":-0.075912}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-27T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-27T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F7a18a139-107c-42da-af7f-53e7e9e24cf6%2Ffbce4640-8341-4110-91e9-0f23a086ccdc%2F58ae0d03-f8f4-4c1d-9ca4-7e0e420048c5.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"cca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca\",\"name\":\"Sonderhaus CIC\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fcca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca%2Fbcbb48c4-878a-40b7-a92b-7614e793e58a.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"the-spoken-room-2\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":36,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":24,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"f2963417-dc91-49fe-bf48-3dfefb29a21d\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"September Film Club 2 - Resident Evil \",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Resident Evil is finally hitting cinemas! This September 19th we will be heading over to the cinema and watching it at film club. We'll have your snacks, drinks, games, pub quiz, prizes and posters... All you have to do is bring yourself!<br><br>Whether you're a fan of the games or love Zach Cregger, we promise you a great day out! SO here's to hoping we see you at the cinema!</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-30T20:08:58.112\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"3de632ed-592c-44bc-aad0-33d28b253599\",\"address\":\"Leicester Square, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Vue West End \",\"latitude\":51.5105486,\"longitude\":-0.130845}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-19T15:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-19T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Ff2963417-dc91-49fe-bf48-3dfefb29a21d%2F5db2b236-2d9b-4e25-a91d-355e7b0b6ce3%2F4c2fbe0f-358e-455b-b061-12bbe4f71d7d.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"3549208b-26d0-4e35-b685-4508bd97302a\",\"name\":\"Filmfluencing \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F3549208b-26d0-4e35-b685-4508bd97302a%2F34d01062-ca41-4e5c-abf2-1fbab6955caa.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"september-film-club-2-resident-evil\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":10,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":31,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":5,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"91fe261e-f7f8-4573-b0d8-1f120d798338\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"HHC 2ND ANNIVERSARY CELEBRATION - BASEBALL\",\"description\":\"<p>WE’RE TURNING 2! 🥹🥳 To celebrate two years of HHC, we’re heading to The 108 Centre in Brent Cross for an afternoon of baseball, good vibes and even better company. ⚾️🏟️</p><p>Here’s everything you need to know:<br></p><p>📅 Saturday 26th September</p><p>📍 The 108, Brent Cross, London NW2 1LT</p><p>⏰ 3pm–6pm<br></p><p>Whether you’ve been hiking with us from day one or you’re brand new to the HHC community, everyone is welcome! 🫂🤲<br></p><p>PLEASE NOTE: We’ll also be heading for dinner nearby afterwards! This is completely optional, so feel free to join us for dinner or just come along for the baseball. 🍽️😋</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-09T13:12:25.036\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"c5e79271-c1f9-48e2-be67-aa053b9bead7\",\"address\":\"Brent Terrace, Brent Cross, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"The 108\",\"latitude\":51.5715727,\"longitude\":-0.2262886}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-26T15:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-26T18:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F505cabd5-d347-44ae-b941-1109a473a6ad%2F63ba0030-04fd-41a9-954a-7a9fe1a48c49%2Fe1870942-5460-417c-b161-882763e4bd2d.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450\",\"name\":\"Hot Hikers Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fcd894f79-7036-40f3-a364-71e9d753199b.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"hhc-2nd-anniversary-celebration-baseball\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":22,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":3,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"ca72935d-ee1c-42ab-9612-bfc8554e1c10\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Revival London Archive Sale\",\"description\":\"<h2>Revival London turns 6!<br></h2><p>To mark six years of slow fashion, creativity, and community impact, we're having a pop up!<br></p><p>We’re celebrating with an <strong>Archive Sale Pop Up</strong> and inviting you to shop exclusive<strong> Revival London</strong> pieces at massively discounted prices. Think past collections, one-off designs, samples, and archive gems - truly one-of-a-kind pieces you won't find anywhere else, and once they're gone, they're gone. Whether you've been with us since the beginning or you're just discovering Revival, this is your chance to take home a piece of the journey.<br></p><p>Expect good music, great company, and a celebratory atmosphere. It's a celebration after all!<br></p><p>We're delighted to have <strong>Living Things</strong> pouring the drinks and <strong>Proper</strong> keeping everyone fuelled with snacks throughout the day.<br></p><p>Come through, find a piece that's truly you, meet the community, and toast six years of doing things differently with us. See you there! 💛</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T17:59:34.997\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"cd719e6e-824d-4f1d-8167-03e207064b69\",\"address\":\"108 Stable Street, London N1C 4DQ, UK\",\"locationName\":\"KioskN1C\",\"latitude\":51.5358238,\"longitude\":-0.1261497}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-26T11:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-26T17:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fca72935d-ee1c-42ab-9612-bfc8554e1c10%2Fe66d4222-d68b-411d-8968-a0f22e019685%2F9419ef17-26a7-43dc-ab8f-70073d506e90.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"2ba4cb1f-5147-40f0-b482-32221c6d90e7\",\"name\":\"Revival London\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F2ba4cb1f-5147-40f0-b482-32221c6d90e7%2F5ca086bb-19e6-4031-b7fe-a33a66e95767.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"revival-london-archive-sale\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":1,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"usd\",\"seatsOccupied\":25,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"ec03ce1c-b484-4fb4-8471-ef21e4459d0c\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Meet Us Outside x Gravitate\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Event 004 — A Walk to Balance</strong><br><br><em>Meet Us Outside x Gravitate</em><br></p><p>The equinox is the one day the light and the dark hold each other in perfect balance - the sun sits directly over the equator, and day and night land almost exactly even. For Event 004, we're marking that turning point the way we know how: on our feet, outside, making something with our hands along the way.<br></p><p>We're teaming up with our friends at Gravitate for a one-day hike and creative session out at Box Hill &amp; Westhumble in the Surrey Hills. Meet at Victoria Station at 9:15am, train out together, walk, take some time to land with our breath, guided by Natalia and pause for a creative workshop along the trail, before heading back into London by 3:30pm.<br><br>We'll be pressing and printing with whatever the land offers us that day, so what you take home is made from the exact spot and season it was picked in. <br></p><p><strong>When:</strong> Sunday 20 September 2026, 9:15am – 3:30pm <br><strong>Meet:</strong> Victoria Station<br><strong>Where:</strong> Box Hill &amp; Westhumble (open return train from Victoria) <br><strong>Includes:</strong> Guided hike, breathwork + a creative flower printing workshop <br><br></p><p>Come ready to walk, get artsy and get outside. Comfy shoes you don't mind getting muddy, layers + a waterproof just in case, water bottle, snacks and lunch for the hike, small backpack.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-08T13:50:23.609\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"8bf3de27-7f41-42bc-a9af-3535cb5c5716\",\"address\":\"Victoria Railway Station, Buckingham Palace Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Box Hill & Westhumble\",\"latitude\":51.4942095,\"longitude\":-0.1467259}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-20T09:15:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-20T15:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fec03ce1c-b484-4fb4-8471-ef21e4459d0c%2F9aa0b1a1-763b-46e6-810a-374241246241%2Fe44f02b5-19d9-4fbc-94b8-a331016a0410.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"1b2dd525-5bd8-4270-92a2-9c5adaf2fbba\",\"name\":\"Meet Us Outside\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F1b2dd525-5bd8-4270-92a2-9c5adaf2fbba%2F2a776293-53fa-45b8-bf81-6ce399ab5d44.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"meet-us-outside-x-gravitate\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":4,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":6,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"75b7a751-c89f-483b-9bc0-3288a9105b11\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"BOAT PARTY | END OF SUMMER - LATINAS SOCIETY\",\"description\":\"<h2>PERREO A BORDO 🚤🔥<br></h2><p>Get ready to have the <strong>ultimate Reggaeton party while taking in some of the best views of London at sunset! 🌅</strong><br></p><p>We can’t wait to have you on our <strong>first-ever boat party on Friday, 25th September</strong> bringing you a full night of <strong>Reggaeton, Dembow &amp; Perreo</strong> with <strong>2 amazing DJs live on board</strong> keeping you dancing from start to finish. 🔥<br></p><p>📍 <strong>Boarding:</strong> 6:30 PM MILLBANK MILLENNIUM PIER <br>🚤 <strong>Boat departs:</strong> 7:00 PM SHARP</p><p>Please make sure you arrive at the location <strong>on time</strong> ..the boat will leave at 7 PM and unfortunately cannot wait for late arrivals.<br></p><p>🔞 <strong>18+ ONLY</strong><br>🪪 <strong>Valid ID is required</strong></p><p>Get your best fit ready and bring your friends!<br></p><p><strong>Nos vemos a bordo!🔥</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-28T18:11:01.043\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"eb79251d-89f5-4e6b-81da-bed1b09b2cbe\",\"address\":\"Millbank, London SW1P 4QP, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Millbank Millennium Pier\",\"latitude\":51.492747,\"longitude\":-0.1252357}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-25T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-25T23:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F75b7a751-c89f-483b-9bc0-3288a9105b11%2F838d5f8d-288b-4800-83b1-071cc35ddf4a%2Fd4f82b4d-651a-4711-8384-d9c42fb11789.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"028f21c3-5edf-46ad-a63b-43eb3d8b52a0\",\"name\":\"Latinas Society\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F028f21c3-5edf-46ad-a63b-43eb3d8b52a0%2F80174931-e1d4-41bb-b0cb-b928a511fb71.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"boat-party-end-of-summer-latinas-society\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":11,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":19,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":58,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Midweek Reset \",\"description\":\"<p>Are you always counting down to the weekend and forgetting to check in with yourself?<br><br>Midweek Reset is a welcoming women's wellness evening designed to help you slow down, reconnect and regulate your mind and body in the middle of a busy. Life moves fast, and it's easy to spend every day rushing from one thing to the next. This is your invitation to pause, breathe and create space just for you.<br><br>Together, we'll explore gentle body movement, breathwork, guided meditation, affirmations and mindfulness practices that help regulate the nervous system and bring you back to the present moment. You'll also have the opportunity to reflect, set intentions and connect with a supportive community of like-minded women.<br><br>This isn't about being flexible or getting every movement right. It's about giving yourself permission to move in a way that feels good, quiet the noise of everyday life and leave feeling calmer, lighter and more connected to yourself.<br><br>What to expect:<br>A welcoming check-in<br>Gentle, mindful body movement<br>Breathwork to regulate the nervous system<br>Guided meditation <br>Positive affirmations and intention setting<br>Space for reflection and connection with other women<br><br>Whether you're new to wellness practices or already on your journey, you'll be welcomed exactly as you are.<br><br>Dress Code : Anything you feel comfortable you can move in<br><br>When: Every other Wednesday, 8:00pm – 9:30pm<br><br><strong>Address:</strong> Unit A, Rowan Apartments, 307A Seven Sisters Road, London, N4<br></p><p><strong>Nearest Tube:</strong> Manor House Station, is a 5-minute walk; Finsbury Park Station is also nearby.<br><br>Price: £15.00<br><br>Take a pause, reconnect with yourself and discover the power of creating a midweek reset.</p><p></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-23T22:54:35.530\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"ef02c60b-7f59-4bd8-b72a-16af6afc69d5\",\"address\":\"Seven Sisters Road, London N4 1FS, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Evoke Studio\",\"latitude\":51.5705985,\"longitude\":-0.0960338}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-07T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910%2Fce0db7fb-b9ad-43a7-8271-30cea38681a9%2Fac9ae74c-0ff4-4daf-9844-5bba1ffb8af0.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc\",\"name\":\"Heaven Is A Mind State \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc%2Fde667a78-a929-47d7-bc86-36892beab7e2.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"midweek-reset-1\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":1,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"7957c209-9c54-4c64-8126-aed1cae3b30f\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"CHBC Weekly Session 24/09\",\"description\":\"<p>Come along to our weekly badminton session for a fun, friendly game and a chance to get active. Whether you're a complete beginner or you've been playing for years, everyone is welcome. It's all about enjoying the game, meeting new people, and having a good time.<br></p><p>Don't forget to bring a bottle of water, and if you have your own badminton racket, bring it along. If not, we've got rackets you can borrow.<br></p><p><strong>Playing till the shuttle drops...</strong><br></p><p><em>DISCLAIMER</em></p><p><u>The venue is a NUT-FREE zone, please could you NOT bring nuts or nut-based products into the venue in any form.</u><br></p><p>All our links: <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://linktr.ee/chbadmintonclub?utm_source=linktree_profile_share&amp;ltsid=3635795a-7f48-4ccb-a0f0-57c07a29c2bc\\\"><u>https://linktr.ee/chbadmintonclub?utm_source=linktree_profile_share&amp;ltsid=3635795a-7f48-4ccb-a0f0-57c07a29c2bc</u></a></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-28T11:30:35.997\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"f6bde80a-616b-40e7-923f-16fdc5b20a6b\",\"address\":\"Lambs Lane South, Rainham, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Harris Academy Rainham\",\"latitude\":51.5165879,\"longitude\":0.206678}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-24T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-24T20:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F7957c209-9c54-4c64-8126-aed1cae3b30f%2Fc3415d59-c097-42d7-9d9c-dd34ea4d2752%2F587c391d-52ba-4a77-951c-b3eb355c87b6.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"26e9ca66-9159-4df9-9e49-044f064ed603\",\"name\":\"C.H Badminton Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F26e9ca66-9159-4df9-9e49-044f064ed603%2Fbfa3d1fa-aea5-4bd2-892e-73e90d024f25.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"chbc-weekly-session-24-09\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"fe01dfa3-571a-4b46-b5fd-a52589949655\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Fengzhen Supperclub - 25th Oct\",\"description\":\"<p>Join your host Jay, for a Chinese &amp; South-East Asian ten-course tasting supper club at his home right by Crystal Palace train station!<br><br>Originally from Mainland China, Jay is a master of spices and flavours. He'll be presenting to you his signature fusion of Chinese and southeast Asian inspired dishes. Enjoy dishes like Chicken Satay, Homemade Pork Baos, Prawn Grapefruit Salad, Beef Rendang, Jay's Aubergine... finishing off with&nbsp;Extra Burnt Basque Cheese Cake. Prepare to meet other likeminded foodies as you'll be dining family-style, sharing food with other guests. A warm welcome friendly atmosphere awaits. A great opportunity to meet people of all ages, from all walks of life.This event is<strong> BYOB</strong> - bring your own drinks for the evening. <br><br>For this event it is not possible to change the menu or cater specifically for any allergies or dietary requirements. For those with serious allergies, please also note that cooking will involve nuts and gluten. <br><br>Sorry no pets at this event.&nbsp;<br><br><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/fengzhensupperclub/\\\">https://www.instagram.com/fengzhensupperclub/</a><br><br><strong>MENU &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>WELCOME DRINK - </strong>Glass of Prosecco or orange juice<strong>&nbsp;<br><br>STARTERS<br></strong>Enoki Mushroom Salad, Roasted Almonds **<br>Chicken Satay ** <br>Slow Braised Pork(Dong Po Rou)Baos, Pickled Mooli, Fried Shallots<br>Prawn Grapefruit Salad <strong><br><br>MAINS - </strong>Served with steamed jasmine rice<strong><br></strong>Beef Rendang **<br>Fried Eggs with Spicy Tamarind Dressing **<br>Baked Sea Bream with Lemongrass Turmeric Paste in Banana Leaves *<br>Jay's Aubergine **<br>Bok Choy with Minced Garlic<strong><br><br>DESSERT<br></strong>Extra Burnt Basque Cheese Cake<br><br>Spice Level&nbsp; mild * medium ** high ***</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-06T11:14:18.631\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"bf1b7311-a4bb-4897-ac73-8fa8ee5bf90f\",\"address\":\"Anerley Hill, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\" Crystal Palace train station - 3 minutes walk\",\"latitude\":51.4190328,\"longitude\":-0.0754561}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-25T14:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-25T17:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"GMT\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F883ca0cf-1819-4224-9410-b2df3f13bb01%2Ff81289d2-4e06-4fe7-aa85-e9715df26abb%2Fa65a7416-5fb2-457e-97c3-3ff54f4b1724.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"aa0533f9-6be1-48d7-8f89-5e4e79f7099b\",\"name\":\"fengzhensupperclub\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Faa0533f9-6be1-48d7-8f89-5e4e79f7099b%2F4b698835-0e33-4983-9dd2-e16b1dd49525.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"fengzhen-supperclub-25th-oct\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":0,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":16,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"ZINE MAKING CLUB WITH ARTIZINE \",\"description\":\"<p>Welcome to Artizine Club.<br><br>Artizine Club is the <strong>UK's biggest regular zine-making community</strong>, bringing together curious creatives through a shared love of handmade storytelling, collage and DIY publishing.<br><br>Our creative home is at <strong>The Art House by Acrylicise</strong> — an inspiring venue powered by creativity and design in the heart of East London — where we gather each month for our Club. <br><br>For the past two years, Artizine Club has welcomed hundreds of people to explore zine-making around a table together.&nbsp;Every month we choose a new theme and folding technique, creating space to experiment, tell stories and enjoy the simple pleasure of making something by hand.<br><br>✂️&nbsp;What to expect:<br>- Every session explores a new theme and a different zine folding format<br>- Arrive to a table overflowing with magazines, papers, collage materials and creative supplies, everything you need to start making straight away.<br>- No experience needed. <br><br>Everyone starts somewhere, and we'd love to welcome you to your first zine.<br><br>Why join the Artizine Club?<br>•&nbsp;Learn a wide range of zine-making techniques.<br>• Explore collage, writing and mixed media through playful prompts.<br>• Build your creative confidence and develop your own artistic voice.<br>• Meet a community of curious, like-minded people in a relaxed and inclusive space.<br>• Take time away from your screen to slow down, make, and reconnect with your inner self.<br><br>Come once or join us each month as a regular;&nbsp;either way, you’ll leave with your own handmade zine (and a full heart).<br><br>⭐️ Each new member receives a zine club sticker and member card. ⭐️<br><br><strong>About Artizine:</strong><br><br>Artizine is led by London-based artist&nbsp;Ioana Simion. Rooted in play, participation, and DIY publishing, Ioana creates welcoming spaces for people to explore their creativity and share stories. Since 2019, she has facilitated workshops with major cultural institutions and grassroots groups alike. Her approach celebrates process over perfection, centering the radical spirit of analog emotion and collective expression.<br><br>🤳🏼 Follow on&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/stories/artizineuk/?hl=en\\\" title=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/stories/artizineuk/?hl=en\\\"><strong><u>Instagram</u></strong></a>.<br>📬 Subscribe to the&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://artizine.substack.com/\\\" title=\\\"https://linktr.ee/artizineuk\\\"><strong><u>newsletter</u></strong></a><br>📧 Any questions? Drop us a line at&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:artizineuk@gmail.com\\\"><strong><u>artizineuk@gmail.com</u></strong></a>.<br><br><strong>About The Art House:</strong><br><br><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://thearthouse.live/\\\" title=\\\"https://thearthouse.live/\\\"><u>The Art House</u></a>&nbsp;is a dedicated space for cultural exchange, offering event space to support London’s creative community. Designed to help contemporary arts and culture thrive, it provides a home for collaboration, experimentation, and connection. The Art House is part of&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.acrylicize.com/\\\" title=\\\"https://www.acrylicize.com/\\\"><u>Acrylicise</u></a>, a global creative studio powered by art and culture, and inspired by people and place. <br><br>🤳🏼 Follow on&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/thearthouselive/?hl=en\\\" title=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/thearthouselive/?hl=en\\\"><u>Instagram.</u></a><br>📮 Subscribe to the&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://acrylicize.us17.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=65004db4ef41eb2350603be5c&amp;id=cd732476dc\\\" title=\\\"https://acrylicize.us17.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=65004db4ef41eb2350603be5c&amp;id=cd732476dc\\\"><u>newsletter&nbsp;</u></a>for early access to their programme.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-08T15:22:09.797\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"2735b689-02fd-41e4-aab9-2879d468d7a7\",\"address\":\"30-36 Pritchard's Rd, London E2 9AP, UK\",\"locationName\":\"The Art House by Acrylicise\",\"latitude\":51.53305109999999,\"longitude\":-0.06167429999999999}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-28T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-28T20:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52%2F4b6884fa-54dc-4b1b-8c45-815e95968113%2F81200eb3-8010-4eeb-a686-c0543638832b.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"fcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3\",\"name\":\"Artizine \",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Ffcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3%2F2ef888cf-09af-4115-b6da-290b89f3ecf6.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"zine-making-club-with-artizine-1\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":25,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":5,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"644f7d2d-dc0d-4b7b-a6d7-b26a2d6f6e67\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"'HOME' - Second Home\",\"description\":\"<p>Second Home welcomes Second Space back for another beautiful East London event under the theme 'HOME'. <br><br>A night of Open Mic and 3 featured headliners. <br><br>BUY AN OPEN MIC TICKET TO PERFORM! All who buy an open mic ticket are guaranteed to perform. <br><br>Theme for open mic-ers is not a requirement, just come with your best bars! <br><br>Winner of the open mic competition will Headline a Second Space event in the future.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-15T13:19:34.501\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"9f0d172b-fc3b-4258-937b-404592d998f7\",\"address\":\"68-80 Hanbury Street, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Second Home\",\"latitude\":51.51983360000001,\"longitude\":-0.0716142}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-26T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"GMT\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F644f7d2d-dc0d-4b7b-a6d7-b26a2d6f6e67%2F82191eff-59d0-4fe0-bffc-c88ae7f4934d%2Ff31af4ea-253e-4e66-ae6a-e7a5584e9607.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b\",\"name\":\"SECOND SPACE.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b%2F5db93e84-59e9-4e6f-a52b-b6904d1e6178.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"home-second-home\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"01af992d-6390-40c5-a3f7-56a612d73028\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Cooking on Decks x Mama Ky's Caribbean Soulfood\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Cooking on Decks is back.</strong><br></p><p>A laid-back Saturday built around music, food, and community.</p><p>DJs playing full sets from the kitchen, good energy in the room, and space to actually enjoy being present.<br></p><p>Expect a slow afternoon with DJs soundtracking the day, food flowing from <strong>Mama Ky’s</strong>, conversations happening naturally, and no pressure to rush anywhere. Come through to eat, listen, catch up with friends, or just sit back and take it in.<br></p><p>Whether you’ve been before or it’s your first time, Cooking on Decks is about creating an easy, welcoming space where everything feels intentional but never forced.<br></p><p><strong>Good music, good food, good people.</strong><br></p><p>Celebrating something? Whether it’s a birthday, leaving drinks, a reunion, or any special occasion, feel free to get in touch and we’ll see how we can make it part of the day.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-14T05:36:23.847\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"4bb1cc8e-a007-4291-b603-3e2433c6144e\",\"address\":\"72 Rivington St, London EC2A 3AY, United Kingdom\",\"locationName\":\"Bread and Butter Lounge\",\"latitude\":51.5261287,\"longitude\":-0.0792793}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-03T12:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-03T17:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F01af992d-6390-40c5-a3f7-56a612d73028%2F7f2ba641-f1f2-42ae-9d93-b53a6dc552e4%2F34b092ea-5e96-406d-b2ce-efad27976de7.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"cca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca\",\"name\":\"Sonderhaus CIC\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fcca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca%2Fbcbb48c4-878a-40b7-a92b-7614e793e58a.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"cooking-on-decks-x-mama-ky-s-caribbean-soulfood\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":4,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"🏔️🥾 HOT HIKERS x WHITE CLIFFS OF DOVER HIKE 🥾🏔\",\"description\":\"<p>Hello Hot Hikers! 🌞👋🏾<br></p><p>We’re back to regular programming! 🎉 And we’re very excited to announce that our next hike is on Saturday 19th September, as we head out of London to explore the famous White Cliffs of Dover. 🏔️🌊</p><p>It’s been a little while since we’ve all hiked together, so we’re especially excited for this one, and we hope as many of you as possible can join us! 🫂💚🧡<br></p><p>Here’s everything you need to know 👇🏾<br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>🗺️🧭📍 HIKE ROUTE + DETAILS</p><p>We’ll be completing the White Cliffs of Dover Circular.</p><p>Check out the full route details here ⤵️</p><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.alltrails.com/en-gb/trail/england/kent/white-cliffs-of-dover-circular?p=-1&amp;sh=o8hdcq&amp;u=i&amp;utm_medium=trail_share&amp;utm_source=alltrails_virality\\\">https://www.alltrails.com/en-gb/trail/england/kent/white-cliffs-of-dover-circular?p=-1&amp;sh=o8hdcq&amp;u=i&amp;utm_medium=trail_share&amp;utm_source=alltrails_virality</a><br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>🚆🚎🚘 TRAVEL LOGISTICS</p><p>As we’re heading just outside of London, we’ll need to grab train tickets 🎟️</p><p>📍 Route: London Charing Cross ➡️ Dover Priory</p><p>🚆 Outbound: 10:04am</p><p>🚆 Return: Open return (Time N/A)</p><p>We’ll need to board the 10:04am train from London Charing Cross to Dover Priory.</p><p>Excluding the booking fee, open-return adult tickets are currently around £35 on Trainline. If you have a Railcard or are eligible for GroupSave, you may be able to reduce the cost even further. ✅</p><p>Once we arrive at Dover Priory, we’ll walk through town towards our starting point near the White Cliffs of Dover Coffee Shop, which should take around 45 minutes.</p><p>With this in mind, we’re aiming to:</p><p>🕛 Start the hike: 12:30 - 1:00pm</p><p>🏁 Finish: 3:00 - 4:00pm at the latest</p><p>Of course, if these travel arrangements don’t work for you, feel free to organise an alternative option that’s more convenient and works better for you!<br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>📋🎒 WHAT TO EXPECT + REMINDERS</p><p>As always, expect a full day of:</p><p>✨ Positive energy</p><p>🎲 A quiz on the local area &amp; history</p><p>🫂 Community vibes</p><p>🌿 Nature, movement &amp; connection</p><p>Please wear comfortable, weather-appropriate hiking clothes and suitable footwear, and don’t forget to bring:</p><p>✅ Plenty of water</p><p>✅ Lunch/snacks</p><p>✅ Any personal essentials</p><p>✅Power Bank</p><p>✅ Your best vibes 😎<br></p><p>We’re already buzzing for our 6th hike of the year! 🥳</p><p>Can’t wait to see you all out on the cliffs! 🔜🏔️💚🧡</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-02T19:50:57.746\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"541c06f9-0084-4393-b54c-4a991f66e6c4\",\"address\":\"The Strand, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"\",\"latitude\":51.5110832,\"longitude\":-0.1197104}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-19T10:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-19T16:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0%2F56685e35-0d4d-4266-8b1b-d59f603f817e%2F8e4a7f9b-c222-44c2-86d3-5913c521afa1.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450\",\"name\":\"Hot Hikers Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fcd894f79-7036-40f3-a364-71e9d753199b.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"hot-hikers-x-white-cliffs-of-dover-hike\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":3,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":8,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"07c5590c-3219-4fd6-b535-a1f357684f17\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"DISS TRACKS\",\"description\":\"<p>What are the greatest Diss Tracks of all time? Kendrick's 'Not Like Us'? Chip's 'Coward'? You're about to hear some original diss tracks from the best emerging poets, rappers, singers and spoken word artists live at Second Space.<br><br>5 phenomenal headline artists- including the previous months open mic winner!<br><br>5 Open Mic performances picked at random on the night!<br><br>Music all night from the formidable, fire, flames soundsbyshaq on the decks. <br><br>See you there, you don't want to miss this one!</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-15T13:11:16.272\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"27b38f7e-c1cd-4bdf-a971-e4c3ac0e788a\",\"address\":\"222 Brixton Road, London SW9 6AH, UK\",\"locationName\":\"GoHub Studio\",\"latitude\":51.4720993,\"longitude\":-0.1130211}],\"startDate\":\"2026-10-15T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-15T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F07c5590c-3219-4fd6-b535-a1f357684f17%2F217667c8-c37c-4293-8bce-ff712b0a3047%2Fc4a80d54-ca2c-4504-8051-8a149e27d1cc.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b\",\"name\":\"SECOND SPACE.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b%2F5db93e84-59e9-4e6f-a52b-b6904d1e6178.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"diss-tracks\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"5fbcf004-ba37-472e-870a-1a6c492674b4\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"London's Biggest Warehouse Art Exhibition Party \",\"description\":\"<p><u>The Interactive Warehouse Exhibition Party You Weren’t Supposed to Know About</u><br><br>Paint on walls with a professional artist, live RnB music, drinks, a limited edition fashion collection &amp; a room full of creative professionals .<br><br><br><u>What do you get? </u><br><strong><br></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><u>Live Interactive Art</u>:</strong> Lisbon-based multidisciplinary artist André Drean Lopes brings his signature blue-and-white <em>azulejo</em>-inspired palette to life through live art and artisanal fashion design.</p></li></ul><p><br><br></p><ul><li><p><strong><u>Live R&amp;B</u>:</strong> Atmospheric live music builds in energy throughout the night, transitioning lighting and ambient sounds as the live performance unfolds.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><br></p><ul><li><p><strong><u>Experimental Food Menu</u>:</strong> Taste an interactive concept menu that challenges traditional dining formats, using food as a medium to complement the artwork.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong><u>Exclusive Fashion Drop</u>:</strong> Browse and purchase limited-edition collaborative apparel and small accessories created with clothing brand Custard Shop.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p></p><ul><li><p><strong><u>Creative Networking</u>:</strong> Connect, collaborate, and share ideas with fellow creative professionals, artists, and founders across food, music, dance, photography, fashion, and art.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Event Details</u></strong><br><br><br><strong><u>Where:</u></strong> Candid Arts Centre, 3 Torrens St, London EC1V 1NQ</p><p><strong><u>When:</u></strong> 19th of September 2026 <br>6:30pm - 11:00pm<br><br><br>Please note we have a no-refund policy. All ticket sales are final and non-refundable, except where a refund is required by applicable law or where the event is cancelled by Sixth Space.</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-16T10:26:13.198\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"eaa2c519-8692-4017-99c2-732ade6e060d\",\"address\":\"3 Torrens St, London EC1V 1NQ, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Candid Arts Trust\",\"latitude\":51.5323505,\"longitude\":-0.1052823}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-19T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-19T23:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F88643b27-2e9f-4364-b1c4-619f946c2162%2F3378753f-533a-4b24-8811-ed3ab2d8db68%2Fa600ac3f-a47e-402c-b712-13df488e52b2.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"f9a0f954-e345-45ac-aa8c-6323885a213b\",\"name\":\"Sixth Space\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Ff9a0f954-e345-45ac-aa8c-6323885a213b%2Fd24eccc7-071b-4914-b13b-bbc916f33b21.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"london-s-biggest-warehouse-art-exhibition-party\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":23,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":15,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":125,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"193cda9e-8e08-4885-a218-2604c8635b86\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"RTG MIDWEEK SOCIAL\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Midweek social with organised games, great energy, and a welcoming atmosphere.<br><br>FAQS<br><br>How do the sessions run?<br>We would start with an ice breaker. Each court is organised by skill level; Beginners (20 minutes of coaching plus social play), intermediate (7 minutes games with rotations), Advanced (First to 7 points, the winners stay on for 2 games)<br><br>Can I come alone? Definitely!, we are a friendly and welcoming community at RTG and solo players are always to join<br><br>Is parking available? Yes, there is fe parking on site and the venue is easily accessible via public transport </strong><br><br><strong>Refund Policy We are unable to offer refunds within 48 hours of the event</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-09T10:02:12.699\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"8970073c-e324-4a9d-8cda-bf9206985121\",\"address\":\"1 Triumph Road, London E6 5LW, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Rocket Padel Beckton\",\"latitude\":51.5137624,\"longitude\":0.0560228}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-23T19:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-23T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F193cda9e-8e08-4885-a218-2604c8635b86%2F9ad0c851-65fe-44ad-9304-b464021e5338%2F9603ae5f-33b1-4f85-b1f3-4f2d2988b78f.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5\",\"name\":\"RTG Padel\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5%2Fa7d7602d-e4a7-464e-bdc2-64605be78c6a.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"rtg-midweek-social-3\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"new\",\"likedCount\":2,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":20,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":5,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"e94bb2ae-9ddf-4104-b14a-1d4c5c1a2bab\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Live at Juliana's by ROHY Music\",\"description\":\"<p>LIVE AT JULIANA'S 🎶 <br><br>Join us for an evening of live R&amp;B, meaningful conversations and great company. <br><br>Live at Juliana's is an intimate after-work social celebrating the next generation of R&amp;B talent while bringing together young creatives, modern professionals and music lovers in one space. Whether you're looking to discover new artists, meet like-minded people, catch up with old friends or make new connections, this is an evening designed for good music and even better community. <br><br>Come unwind, connect and experience a night where music brings people together. <br><br>✨ 25 September 2026 <br>📍Anthologist <br>🎵 Presented by ROHY Music in collaboration with Juliana's Social Club See you there.<br><br>PSA:</p><p>🚭 No smoking</p><p>🚫 No drugs</p><p>If you see anything that doesn't look right, including abuse or someone making you or someone else uncomfortable, please report it to Kwame and we will take appropriate action.<br></p><p>Disclaimer: 📸🎥 Please be aware that photography and videography will take place at this event. By attending, you may be photographed or filmed, and this content may be used for promotional and social media purposes by Juliana’s Social Club</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-26T00:16:44.862\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"0f6d40b2-0341-43ba-b7d4-713cae9dd276\",\"address\":\"Gresham Street, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"The Anthologist\",\"latitude\":51.5154254,\"longitude\":-0.0933486}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-25T20:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-25T23:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F23028cb5-9ba9-4a66-952c-390e5af68b1a%2F1a243e96-6733-48ea-8e17-9da4e64acf96%2F8a63dacf-026f-4b0b-867c-497c55eb328b.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"1e70e4dc-0fa2-4354-8c0a-25907e9e7cda\",\"name\":\"Juliana's Social Club\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F1e70e4dc-0fa2-4354-8c0a-25907e9e7cda%2Fc02496c5-2e77-41d7-97fe-7096e2e8b5d8.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"live-at-juliana-s-by-rohy-music\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":8,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":70,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":30,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"f68612a3-224f-4ddb-8eb5-d03b2d3b723c\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Karaoke Night | Latinas Society\",\"description\":\"<p>Welcome to our <strong>Karaoke Night &amp; Room del desamoor </strong>with Latinas Society! 🎤❤️‍🔥<br></p><p>Get ready for <strong>2.5 hours of karaoke</strong> in a luxury karaoke space in the heart of Soho, where you can sing your heart out, embrace your despecho y cantar de TODOOO!<br></p><p>And we’re not stopping there… 👀<br></p><p>After karaoke, we’re taking the party into the night with an <strong>after-party until midnight</strong>.</p><p><br>🔞 <strong>18+ EVENT — PHYSICAL ID REQUIRED FOR ENTRY.</strong></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-03T17:46:40.192\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"8d6e8c3c-f878-4c8c-a33e-29d1d49d404c\",\"address\":\"47 Whitcomb St., London WC2H 7DH, UK\",\"locationName\":\"U9 Karaoke & Cocktail Bar\",\"latitude\":51.5098725,\"longitude\":-0.1314789}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fe1779285-f44c-40a6-b116-317c43b686e4%2F0345cf14-05f9-49a0-a9ea-911f0a962ea6%2Fd0ca5b2e-4e52-4fe4-945b-a4c47da08877.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"028f21c3-5edf-46ad-a63b-43eb3d8b52a0\",\"name\":\"Latinas Society\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F028f21c3-5edf-46ad-a63b-43eb3d8b52a0%2F80174931-e1d4-41bb-b0cb-b928a511fb71.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"karaoke-night-latinas-society\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":2,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":83,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":17,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"25cc0603-2fcd-4057-9adc-3594e119d429\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"'I LOVE YOU...BUT'\",\"description\":\"<p>Best words in the English language are 'I LOVE YOU' right?? What if 'but' followed those words? Kinda painful innit? Lets explore that together with poetry, spoken word, and sensational vibes as always!!<br><br>5 phenomenal headline artists- including the previous months open mic winner!<br><br>5 Open Mic performances picked at random on the night!<br><br>Music all night from the formidable, fire, flames soundsbyshaq on the decks.<br><br> See you there, you don't want to miss this one!</p><p><br></p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-15T13:30:26.053\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"2b4373bd-ff20-4db8-a4fe-5dc18e974912\",\"address\":\"222 Brixton Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"GoHub Studio\",\"latitude\":51.4720993,\"longitude\":-0.1130211}],\"startDate\":\"2026-11-19T19:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-11-19T21:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"GMT\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F25cc0603-2fcd-4057-9adc-3594e119d429%2F76489111-410f-4ff1-8018-c91afeffc102%2F0131dcd0-370f-4bd7-a560-85330982f47e.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b\",\"name\":\"SECOND SPACE.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F886d7532-bffe-46d7-bd85-79cebf5ff82b%2F5db93e84-59e9-4e6f-a52b-b6904d1e6178.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"i-love-you-but\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":0,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":null,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":0,\"suggestedFriend\":null},{\"id\":\"1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a\",\"target\":\"event\",\"name\":\"Mario Kart Tuesdays\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Sonderhaus Mario Kart Nights🏁</strong><br></p><p>Every Tuesday at Sevente, we host a community-led Mario Kart night built around play, competition and connection. Players are randomly seeded into a knockout tournament bracket, with races projected live as competitors battle through each round for the win and a prize at the end of the night.<br></p><p>But it’s always been bigger than just the tournament. People come to race, watch, meet new faces, catch up with friends, have drinks and enjoy the atmosphere. It’s a relaxed social space where gaming becomes a reason to connect.<br></p><p>Alongside the tournament, we occasionally introduce DJs, special formats, live performances, giveaways and collaborations to keep each edition fresh while staying true to the spirit of the night.</p><p>Whether you’re competitive or just looking for a good Tuesday night out, there’s a place for you in the room.<br></p><p>• Every Tuesday</p><p>• Sevente, 283 Hackney Rd, E2 8NA</p><p>• Doors 6PM</p>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T14:45:01.393\",\"locations\":[{\"id\":\"033b44c7-53ea-4674-810c-9684eec93e94\",\"address\":\"283 Hackney Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Sevente\",\"latitude\":51.5312303,\"longitude\":-0.06780209999999999}],\"startDate\":\"2026-09-29T18:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-29T22:30:00.000\",\"timeZone\":\"Europe/London\",\"timeZoneAbbreviation\":\"BST\",\"image\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a%2F43255e30-3122-462c-ab71-1fb2b0a4bedb%2F192dab7c-ae95-4a35-8742-b3152e6dc176.webp\",\"company\":{\"id\":\"cca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca\",\"name\":\"Sonderhaus CIC\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fcca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca%2Fbcbb48c4-878a-40b7-a92b-7614e793e58a.webp\"},\"url\":null},\"events\":[],\"city\":{\"id\":\"ef6c2cc0-ef51-4f87-8835-ae615b6b7841\",\"name\":\"London\",\"country\":\"UK\",\"longitude\":-0.1275862,\"latitude\":51.5072178},\"slug\":\"mario-kart-tuesdays-4\",\"intentFriends\":[],\"status\":\"normal\",\"likedCount\":1,\"isBought\":false,\"isLiked\":false,\"leftSeats\":37,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"seatsOccupied\":3,\"suggestedFriend\":null}],\"pagination\":{\"pageSize\":200,\"page\":1,\"total\":27,\"totalPages\":1}}",
