            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":true,\"name\":\"GoodFilmHunting #5\",\"description\":\"<p>Goodfilm Hunting #5<br><br>Quick recap for the newcomers: we are Goodfilm Hunting, a London-based film club started by 3 friends, on a mission to build a community around cinema. <br><br>We get it, life gets busy, and a 3-hour pretentious film in a language you can’t speak without any English subs or even sound for that matter isn’t always what the evening calls for. So we’ve done the curation for you: a series of 90-minute bangers (give or take), films you might not have caught before, ones that spark great conversations and might just inspire you to venture deeper into cinema. <br><br>This time round we’re moving our asses to the mystical Pedaller’s Corner in Stoke Newington for a special summery Spanish edition. <br><br>Tickets are limited, so grab yours and share with your people: friends, family, colleagues, bingo partners, whoever. <br><br>Love, Monty, Tom and Hugo</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T23:00:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"08b3f4f7-0117-4825-a4c9-14bd75730b1f\",\"address\":\"129-131 Stoke Newington Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Pedaller's Corner - Cafe\",\"latitude\":51.5562012,\"longitude\":-0.07475989999999999},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1/6b085b9a-b7ad-46c6-a3ba-04b89c2046ea/3b34e96d-e5d8-4bee-a670-9f99f3afa470.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1%2F6b085b9a-b7ad-46c6-a3ba-04b89c2046ea%2F3b34e96d-e5d8-4bee-a670-9f99f3afa470.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"f5397fc7-e665-476e-8b6d-3eae8344c345\",\"name\":\"Goodfilm Hunting #5: Film + Food\",\"description\":\"Ticket plus a simple dinner cooked by our Pedaller's Corner host - usually themed around the film.\",\"maxQuantity\":25,\"sold\":18,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-08-09T19:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"12.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1\",\"programId\":null},{\"id\":\"7904673f-38d4-46ae-93e5-3668a73fa566\",\"name\":\"Goodfilm Hunting #5: Just the Film\",\"description\":\"\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":12,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-08-09T19:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-17T19:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"9.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"57c6c476-f1a3-488d-be78-ba3a1f42e7a1\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":40,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":15,\"eventsCount\":4,\"attendeesCount\":27,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"goodfilmhunting\",\"bio\":\"We are Goodfilm Hunting, a London-based film club started by 3 friends, on a mission to build a community around cinema.   \\n\\nWe get it, life gets busy, and a 3-hour pretentious film in a language you can’t speak without any English subs or even sound for that matter isn’t always what the evening calls for. So we’ve done the curation for you: a series of 90-minute bangers (give or take), films you might not have caught before, ones that spark great conversations and might just inspire you to venture deeper into cinema.   \\n\\n   Tickets are limited, so grab yours and share with your people: friends, family, colleagues, bingo partners, whoever.   \\n\\nLove, Monty, Tom and Hugo\\n\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-17T12:29:23.740Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-29T15:18:28.689Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Tom Couffon, Hugo Brown, Monty Pritchard\",\"eventsNumber\":3,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/ebf2f7ac-9