            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Coffeehouse Cinema London\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Coffeehouse Cinema is coming to London.</strong></p><p>Join us for an evening of great movies, meaningful conversation, and connection with filmmakers and fellow film lovers.</p><p>Coffeehouse Cinema is built around a simple idea: films are better when we experience them together. Every screening brings new stories, new filmmakers, and new people into the room, creating a space for discovery, conversation, and community.</p><p>For the first time, we’re bringing that experience to London.<br></p><p><strong>Curated short films. Watched together.</strong><br></p><p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p><p>Come early, grab a drink, and settle in with fellow filmmakers and film lovers before the screening begins.<br></p><p>At 7:00 PM, we’ll kick off a curated program of short films selected by Coffeehouse Cinema. After the films, stick around for conversation with the filmmakers and the people behind the work.<br></p><p>The evening is designed to feel less like a traditional theater screening and more like gathering with a room full of people who genuinely love movies.<br></p><p><strong>Expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>A thoughtfully curated selection of short films</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Time to meet filmmakers, creatives, and fellow film lovers</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Conversation and filmmaker Q&amp;A following the screening</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>A relaxed atmosphere at Mason &amp; Fifth</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Plenty of time to hang out and connect before and after the films</strong></p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Come for the movies. Stay for the conversation.</strong><br></p><p><strong>Event Details</strong></p><p><strong>Wednesday, September 23rd</strong></p><p><strong>Mason &amp; Fifth, Westbourne Park</strong><br>11 Woodfield Road<br>London W9 2BA<br>United Kingdom</p><p></p><p><strong>Doors Open: 6:30 PM</strong><br><strong>Screening Begins: 7:00 PM</strong><br></p><p><strong>Tickets: £15</strong></p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-23T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-23T22:30:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"827f0518-4ccc-4d45-8967-9649c2fbffd2\",\"address\":\"11 Woodfield Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Mason & Fifth, Westbourne Park\",\"latitude\":51.52295969999999,\"longitude\":-0.1995926},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d/452aee7c-aae4-4f87-8061-05553ae9ca69/5de99053-2449-48e3-8692-c5f0c9d2208c.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d%2F452aee7c-aae4-4f87-8061-05553ae9ca69%2F5de99053-2449-48e3-8692-c5f0c9d2208c.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"1a031a3c-98ac-4014-aa8f-2b1f662fb6ef\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"description\":\"\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":2,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-14T04:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-23T22:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"10.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"28338155-c33c-455d-af10-adfd5a68cd9d\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":50,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":85,\"eventsCount\":14,\"attendeesCount\":271,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"coffeehouse-cinema\",\"bio\":\"Short Film Screening and Event Series out of a coffee shop\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-02T17:46:29.788Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-02T23:06:54.858Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Ellis Sutton\",\"eventsNumber\":8,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/6467e714-060a-4562-838c-b2684aadd99c/bc5a2702-0feb-4e8c-a41b-02ef2a9b