            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"RTG PADEL TOURNAMENT\",\"description\":\"<p>RTG Padel is back with another competitive day on court, bringing together players for a full afternoon of competitive padel.<br></p><p>Expect competitive matches, a great atmosphere and the chance to battle it out for the <strong>£300 cash prize for the winning team</strong>.<br></p><p>📅 <strong>Saturday 10th October</strong><br>⏰ <strong>11:30am – 5:00pm</strong><br>📍 <strong>Power League Romford, RM7 7AY</strong><br>🎾 <strong>Level: Intermediate+</strong><br>💷 <strong>£45 per player</strong><br>🏆 <strong>£300 cash prize for the winning team</strong></p><p><strong>2nd and 3rd place prizes are still to be determined and will be announced ahead of the tournament.</strong><br></p><p>Whether you're looking to test yourself against new players, compete for the trophy or enjoy a proper day of competitive padel, this tournament is for you.<br></p><p><strong>Please note: Tickets are non-refundable.</strong></p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-10T11:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-10T17:00:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"e12673ef-f5c6-4462-a9c8-169d9a9abb9e\",\"address\":\"Eastern Avenue West, Romford RM7 7AY, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Power League Romford\",\"latitude\":51.5839789,\"longitude\":0.1684574},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/a97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd/5be8cdcc-1725-40f0-8f2b-892a7313c426/86db9679-cc5c-4656-8891-6413935ed815.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2Fa97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd%2F5be8cdcc-1725-40f0-8f2b-892a7313c426%2F86db9679-cc5c-4656-8891-6413935ed815.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"dba5c5bc-f623-41b4-a523-ded2e41a325b\",\"name\":\"RTG participation ticket / for  player\",\"description\":\"£90 per pair. This playing ticket covers entry for you and your partner (2 players) into the RTG Padel Tournament. Please purchase one ticket per pair. Tickets are non-refundable.\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":0,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-12T12:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-10T12:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"90.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"a97a5485-7539-4b21-aa00-2b666ab6c7dd\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":16,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":40,\"eventsCount\":29,\"attendeesCount\":211,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"rtg-padel\",\"bio\":\"RTG Padel is a London-based padel community hosting socials, events and private hires 🎾. We bring people together through sport, good vibes ✨ and competitive games for all levels 💪.\\n\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-10T08:57:59.499Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-24T11:59:08.144Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"RTG PADEL\",\"eventsNumber\":19,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/e5032f6b-c98f-43ce-8279-5b72b3f86ef2/9b7a1f45-1710-44e5-ac01-0fb3d6c3a2f2.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/founders%2Fe5032f6b-c98f-43ce-8279-5b72b3f86ef2%2F9b7a1f45-1710-44e5-ac01-0fb3d6c3a2f2.webp\"}},\"isPrivate\":false,\"isShownPreviewImagesPopup\":true,\"previewImages\":[{\"filePath\":\"companies/7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5/preview/bc1a3d57-16ac-45b8-b03d-0daca6bb70d0.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5%2Fpreview%2Fbc1a3d57-16ac-45b8-b03d-0daca6bb70d0.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5/preview/714a6cd1-1a45-4bf3-a18b-043863d88c79.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5%2Fpre