y, accident, loss or damage arising from participation, except where liability cannot legally be excluded.\\n\\nAll tickets are non-refundable.\\n\\nBy purchasing a ticket, you confirm that you have read and agreed to these terms.\",\"isEmpty\":false,\"lastChangeTextDate\":\"2026-09-11T18:16:26.908Z\",\"companyId\":\"7a2ef793-fa85-4a8e-8aa7-30df20695bc5\",\"parentId\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-11T18:16:26.909Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-09-11T18:16:26.909Z\"},\"isWaiverRequired\":true}",
