          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Midweek Reset \",\"description\":\"<p>Are you always counting down to the weekend and forgetting to check in with yourself?<br><br>Midweek Reset is a welcoming women's wellness evening designed to help you slow down, reconnect and regulate your mind and body in the middle of a busy. Life moves fast, and it's easy to spend every day rushing from one thing to the next. This is your invitation to pause, breathe and create space just for you.<br><br>Together, we'll explore gentle body movement, breathwork, guided meditation, affirmations and mindfulness practices that help regulate the nervous system and bring you back to the present moment. You'll also have the opportunity to reflect, set intentions and connect with a supportive community of like-minded women.<br><br>This isn't about being flexible or getting every movement right. It's about giving yourself permission to move in a way that feels good, quiet the noise of everyday life and leave feeling calmer, lighter and more connected to yourself.<br><br>What to expect:<br>A welcoming check-in<br>Gentle, mindful body movement<br>Breathwork to regulate the nervous system<br>Guided meditation <br>Positive affirmations and intention setting<br>Space for reflection and connection with other women<br><br>Whether you're new to wellness practices or already on your journey, you'll be welcomed exactly as you are.<br><br>Dress Code : Anything you feel comfortable you can move in<br><br>When: Every other Wednesday, 8:00pm – 9:30pm<br><br><strong>Address:</strong> Unit A, Rowan Apartments, 307A Seven Sisters Road, London, N4<br></p><p><strong>Nearest Tube:</strong> Manor House Station, is a 5-minute walk; Finsbury Park Station is also nearby.<br><br>Price: £15.00<br><br>Take a pause, reconnect with yourself and discover the power of creating a midweek reset.</p><p></p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-07T21:30:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"ef02c60b-7f59-4bd8-b72a-16af6afc69d5\",\"address\":\"Seven Sisters Road, London N4 1FS, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Evoke Studio\",\"latitude\":51.5705985,\"longitude\":-0.0960338},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910/ce0db7fb-b9ad-43a7-8271-30cea38681a9/ac9ae74c-0ff4-4daf-9844-5bba1ffb8af0.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910%2Fce0db7fb-b9ad-43a7-8271-30cea38681a9%2Fac9ae74c-0ff4-4daf-9844-5bba1ffb8af0.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"528875db-140f-4e4d-88fe-5418a1cdd88a\",\"name\":\"General \",\"description\":\"Entry to one Midweek Reset session. Includes mindful movement, breathwork, meditation, affirmations and community connection.\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":0,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-07T11:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-07T19:00:00.000\",\"price\":\"15.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"7a51a171-9184-4c50-993c-5ac6d792c910\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":10,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":31,\"eventsCount\":3,\"attendeesCount\":9,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"heaven-is-a-mind-state\",\"bio\":\"Hi, I'm Shannon \\n\\nI created Heaven Is A Mind State as a space for women to reconnect with themselves through mindfulness, movement and meaningful connection.\\n\\nTo me, everything begins with the mind. When we slow down, become present and take time to check in with ourselves, we create space for growth, healing and balance.\\n\\nMy mission is to bring women together through wellness experiences that nurture both the body and mind. Whether it's yoga, breathwork, meditation or simply creating a welcoming space to connect, every event is designed to help you pause, reset and leave feeling lighter than when you arrived.\\n\\nI'm so happy you're here, and I can't wait to welcome you to the community. \\n\\nThank you and I look forward to this new adventure and journey with you \\n\\nHeaven is A Mind State - Shannon\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-06T15:18:50.031Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T19:02:50.254Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Shannon \",\"eventsNumber\":0,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/876773b5-15fe-46d6-9ced-d166bae3aabf/6e65428e-e6c5-4f97-84c9-aabc3bb84764.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/founders%2F876773b5-15fe-46d6-9ced-d166bae3aabf%2F6e65428e-e6c5-4f97-84c9-aabc3bb84764.webp\"}},\"isPrivate\":false,\"isShownPreviewImagesPopup\":true,\"previewImages\":[{\"filePath\":\"companies/630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc/preview/a26cfd91-4fd7-4b5b-bc71-e2cf5088804a.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc%2Fpreview%2Fa26cfd91-4fd7-4b5b-bc71-e2cf5088804a.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc/preview/f5b1a000-94c2-4128-9056-201c999e4ee2.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc%2Fpreview%2Ff5b1a000-94c2-4128-9056-201c999e4ee2.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc/preview/00b72058-3bf0-422d-9eea-8f777f605cf2.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc%2Fpreview%2F00b72058-3bf0-422d-9eea-8f777f605cf2.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc/preview/fa52130c-820e-4931-8a91-f97a99261780.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F630b2a27-1cb6-4af8-8544-db75c93611cc%2Fp