          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"fe01dfa3-571a-4b46-b5fd-a52589949655\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Fengzhen Supperclub - 25th Oct\",\"description\":\"<p>Join your host Jay, for a Chinese &amp; South-East Asian ten-course tasting supper club at his home right by Crystal Palace train station!<br><br>Originally from Mainland China, Jay is a master of spices and flavours. He'll be presenting to you his signature fusion of Chinese and southeast Asian inspired dishes. Enjoy dishes like Chicken Satay, Homemade Pork Baos, Prawn Grapefruit Salad, Beef Rendang, Jay's Aubergine... finishing off with&nbsp;Extra Burnt Basque Cheese Cake. Prepare to meet other likeminded foodies as you'll be dining family-style, sharing food with other guests. A warm welcome friendly atmosphere awaits. A great opportunity to meet people of all ages, from all walks of life.This event is<strong> BYOB</strong> - bring your own drinks for the evening. <br><br>For this event it is not possible to change the menu or cater specifically for any allergies or dietary requirements. For those with serious allergies, please also note that cooking will involve nuts and gluten. <br><br>Sorry no pets at this event.&nbsp;<br><br><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/fengzhensupperclub/\\\">https://www.instagram.com/fengzhensupperclub/</a><br><br><strong>MENU &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>WELCOME DRINK - </strong>Glass of Prosecco or orange juice<strong>&nbsp;<br><br>STARTERS<br></strong>Enoki Mushroom Salad, Roasted Almonds **<br>Chicken Satay ** <br>Slow Braised Pork(Dong Po Rou)Baos, Pickled Mooli, Fried Shallots<br>Prawn Grapefruit Salad <strong><br><br>MAINS - </strong>Served with steamed jasmine rice<strong><br></strong>Beef Rendang **<br>Fried Eggs with Spicy Tamarind Dressing **<br>Baked Sea Bream with Lemongrass Turmeric Paste in Banana Leaves *<br>Jay's Aubergine **<br>Bok Choy with Minced Garlic<strong><br><br>DESSERT<br></strong>Extra Burnt Basque Cheese Cake<br><br>Spice Level&nbsp; mild * medium ** high ***</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-25T14:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-25T17:30:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"bf1b7311-a4bb-4897-ac73-8fa8ee5bf90f\",\"address\":\"Anerley Hill, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\" Crystal Palace train station - 3 minutes walk\",\"latitude\":51.4190328,\"longitude\":-0.0754561},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/883ca0cf-1819-4224-9410-b2df3f13bb01/f81289d2-4e06-4fe7-aa85-e9715df26abb/a65a7416-5fb2-457e-97c3-3ff54f4b1724.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F883ca0cf-1819-4224-9410-b2df3f13bb01%2Ff81289d2-4e06-4fe7-aa85-e9715df26abb%2Fa65a7416-5fb2-457e-97c3-3ff54f4b1724.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"ca805f63-980d-4148-b61d-a1270a2609da\",\"name\":\"Adult - 10 course feast\",\"description\":\"\",\"maxQuantity\":16,\"sold\":16,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-08-06T13:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-10-25T12:00:00.000\",\"price\":\"70.00\",\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"fe01dfa3-571a-4b46-b5fd-a52589949655\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":16,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":true,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":6,\"eventsCount\":1,\"attendeesCount\":8,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"fengzhensupperclub\",\"bio\":\"Join your host Jay, for a Chinese & South-East Asian ten-course tasting supper club at his home right by Crystal Palace train station!\\n\\n\\nPrepare to meet other likeminded foodies as you'll be dining family-style, sharing food with other guests. A warm welcome friendly atmosphere awaits. A great opportunity to meet people of all ages, from all walks of life.\\n\\nEvery event is BYOB - bring your own drinks for the evening. Glasses and table water provide