            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"ZINE MAKING CLUB WITH ARTIZINE \",\"description\":\"<p>Welcome to Artizine Club.<br><br>Artizine Club is the <strong>UK's biggest regular zine-making community</strong>, bringing together curious creatives through a shared love of handmade storytelling, collage and DIY publishing.<br><br>Our creative home is at <strong>The Art House by Acrylicise</strong> — an inspiring venue powered by creativity and design in the heart of East London — where we gather each month for our Club. <br><br>For the past two years, Artizine Club has welcomed hundreds of people to explore zine-making around a table together.&nbsp;Every month we choose a new theme and folding technique, creating space to experiment, tell stories and enjoy the simple pleasure of making something by hand.<br><br>✂️&nbsp;What to expect:<br>- Every session explores a new theme and a different zine folding format<br>- Arrive to a table overflowing with magazines, papers, collage materials and creative supplies, everything you need to start making straight away.<br>- No experience needed. <br><br>Everyone starts somewhere, and we'd love to welcome you to your first zine.<br><br>Why join the Artizine Club?<br>•&nbsp;Learn a wide range of zine-making techniques.<br>• Explore collage, writing and mixed media through playful prompts.<br>• Build your creative confidence and develop your own artistic voice.<br>• Meet a community of curious, like-minded people in a relaxed and inclusive space.<br>• Take time away from your screen to slow down, make, and reconnect with your inner self.<br><br>Come once or join us each month as a regular;&nbsp;either way, you’ll leave with your own handmade zine (and a full heart).<br><br>⭐️ Each new member receives a zine club sticker and member card. ⭐️<br><br><strong>About Artizine:</strong><br><br>Artizine is led by London-based artist&nbsp;Ioana Simion. Rooted in play, participation, and DIY publishing, Ioana creates welcoming spaces for people to explore their creativity and share stories. Since 2019, she has facilitated workshops with major cultural institutions and grassroots groups alike. Her approach celebrates process over perfection, centering the radical spirit of analog emotion and collective expression.<br><br>🤳🏼 Follow on&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/stories/artizineuk/?hl=en\\\" title=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/stories/artizineuk/?hl=en\\\"><strong><u>Instagram</u></strong></a>.<br>📬 Subscribe to the&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://artizine.substack.com/\\\" title=\\\"https://linktr.ee/artizineuk\\\"><strong><u>newsletter</u></strong></a><br>📧 Any questions? Drop us a line at&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"mailto:artizineuk@gmail.com\\\"><strong><u>artizineuk@gmail.com</u></strong></a>.<br><br><strong>About The Art House:</strong><br><br><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://thearthouse.live/\\\" title=\\\"https://thearthouse.live/\\\"><u>The Art House</u></a>&nbsp;is a dedicated space for cultural exchange, offering event space to support London’s creative community. Designed to help contemporary arts and culture thrive, it provides a home for collaboration, experimentation, and connection. The Art House is part of&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.acrylicize.com/\\\" title=\\\"https://www.acrylicize.com/\\\"><u>Acrylicise</u></a>, a global creative studio powered by art and culture, and inspired by people and place. <br><br>🤳🏼 Follow on&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/thearthouselive/?hl=en\\\" title=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/thearthouselive/?hl=en\\\"><u>Instagram.</u></a><br>📮 Subscribe to the&nbsp;<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://acrylicize.us17.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=65004db4ef41eb2350603be5c&amp;id=cd732476dc\\\" title=\\\"https://acrylicize.us17.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=65004db4ef41eb2350603be5c&amp;id=cd732476dc\\\"><u>newsletter&nbsp;</u></a>for early access to their programme.</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-28T18:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-28T20:30:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":true,\"location\":{\"id\":\"2735b689-02fd-41e4-aab9-2879d468d7a7\",\"address\":\"30-36 Pritchard's Rd, London E2 9AP, UK\",\"locationName\":\"The Art House by Acrylicise\",\"latitude\":51.53305109999999,\"longitude\":-0.06167429999999999},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52/4b6884fa-54dc-4b1b-8c45-815e95968113/81200eb3-8010-4eeb-a686-c0543638832b.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52%2F4b6884fa-54dc-4b1b-8c45-815e95968113%2F81200eb3-8010-4eeb-a686-c0543638832b.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"1323b3c6-1c0c-471b-866d-5ffcb7803ad6\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"description\":\"\",\"maxQuantity\":27,\"sold\":2,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-08T15:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-28T17:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"20.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52\",\"programId\":null},{\"id\":\"53cf022c-1276-4695-a206-7b61b7e39434\",\"name\":\"Discounted Tickets \",\"description\":\"This ticket is for anyone who would benefit from a reduced price, including students, low-income individuals, or those currently unwaged. No proof required, just choose what works for you!\",\"maxQuantity\":3,\"sold\":3,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-08T15:30:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-28T17:30:00.000\",\"price\":\"10.00\",\"status\":\"sold-out\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"76351bc0-3823-44e0-9151-b23d9ceaef52\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":30,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":36,\"eventsCount\":100,\"attendeesCount\":58,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"artizine\",\"bio\":\"Artizine is a creative community brought together by a love of zines and handmade storytelling.\\n\\nJoin our monthly Zine Club meet-ups, workshops and special events designed to spark your creativity, nurture your curiosity and connect you with others through DIY publishing.\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-06T11:24:07.237Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T11:46:35.401Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Ioana \",\"eventsNumber\":96,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/ccf74e26-7747-43a5-8cd4-b49a4bc06000/df84e1c6-ab40-4fcf-87aa-2c51d29efa19.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/founders%2Fccf74e26-7747-43a5-8cd4-b49a4bc06000%2Fdf84e1c6-ab40-4fcf-87aa-2c51d29efa19.webp\"}},\"isPrivate\":false,\"isShownPreviewImagesPopup\":true,\"previewImages\":[{\"filePath\":\"companies/fcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3/preview/5bd361f5-b7f7-4e1e-906b-e978506d09b3.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Ffcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3%2Fpreview%2F5bd361f5-b7f7-4e1e-906b-e978506d09b3.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/fcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3/preview/7ac770d4-3d6a-4993-b69f-bdca53039ae3.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Ffcce4a5b-dc08-4a76-ad96-0b87cdb9c8c3%2Fpreview%2F7ac770d4-3d6a-4993-b69f-bdca53039ae3.webp\"