          "headersSize": 230,
          "cookies": [],
          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"🏔️🥾 HOT HIKERS x WHITE CLIFFS OF DOVER HIKE 🥾🏔\",\"description\":\"<p>Hello Hot Hikers! 🌞👋🏾<br></p><p>We’re back to regular programming! 🎉 And we’re very excited to announce that our next hike is on Saturday 19th September, as we head out of London to explore the famous White Cliffs of Dover. 🏔️🌊</p><p>It’s been a little while since we’ve all hiked together, so we’re especially excited for this one, and we hope as many of you as possible can join us! 🫂💚🧡<br></p><p>Here’s everything you need to know 👇🏾<br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>🗺️🧭📍 HIKE ROUTE + DETAILS</p><p>We’ll be completing the White Cliffs of Dover Circular.</p><p>Check out the full route details here ⤵️</p><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"editor-link\\\" href=\\\"https://www.alltrails.com/en-gb/trail/england/kent/white-cliffs-of-dover-circular?p=-1&amp;sh=o8hdcq&amp;u=i&amp;utm_medium=trail_share&amp;utm_source=alltrails_virality\\\">https://www.alltrails.com/en-gb/trail/england/kent/white-cliffs-of-dover-circular?p=-1&amp;sh=o8hdcq&amp;u=i&amp;utm_medium=trail_share&amp;utm_source=alltrails_virality</a><br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>🚆🚎🚘 TRAVEL LOGISTICS</p><p>As we’re heading just outside of London, we’ll need to grab train tickets 🎟️</p><p>📍 Route: London Charing Cross ➡️ Dover Priory</p><p>🚆 Outbound: 10:04am</p><p>🚆 Return: Open return (Time N/A)</p><p>We’ll need to board the 10:04am train from London Charing Cross to Dover Priory.</p><p>Excluding the booking fee, open-return adult tickets are currently around £35 on Trainline. If you have a Railcard or are eligible for GroupSave, you may be able to reduce the cost even further. ✅</p><p>Once we arrive at Dover Priory, we’ll walk through town towards our starting point near the White Cliffs of Dover Coffee Shop, which should take around 45 minutes.</p><p>With this in mind, we’re aiming to:</p><p>🕛 Start the hike: 12:30 - 1:00pm</p><p>🏁 Finish: 3:00 - 4:00pm at the latest</p><p>Of course, if these travel arrangements don’t work for you, feel free to organise an alternative option that’s more convenient and works better for you!<br></p><p>~~~~~~~~~~~</p><p>📋🎒 WHAT TO EXPECT + REMINDERS</p><p>As always, expect a full day of:</p><p>✨ Positive energy</p><p>🎲 A quiz on the local area &amp; history</p><p>🫂 Community vibes</p><p>🌿 Nature, movement &amp; connection</p><p>Please wear comfortable, weather-appropriate hiking clothes and suitable footwear, and don’t forget to bring:</p><p>✅ Plenty of water</p><p>✅ Lunch/snacks</p><p>✅ Any personal essentials</p><p>✅Power Bank</p><p>✅ Your best vibes 😎<br></p><p>We’re already buzzing for our 6th hike of the year! 🥳</p><p>Can’t wait to see you all out on the cliffs! 🔜🏔️💚🧡</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-19T10:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-19T16:00:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"541c06f9-0084-4393-b54c-4a991f66e6c4\",\"address\":\"The Strand, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"\",\"latitude\":51.5110832,\"longitude\":-0.1197104},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0/56685e35-0d4d-4266-8b1b-d59f603f817e/8e4a7f9b-c222-44c2-86d3-5913c521afa1.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0%2F56685e35-0d4d-4266-8b1b-d59f603f817e%2F8e4a7f9b-c222-44c2-86d3-5913c521afa1.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"b815b70d-9613-44b7-8af2-47e010c2b216\",\"name\":\"Hike Pass\",\"description\":\"\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":8,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-03T06:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-19T08:00:00.000\",\"price\":\"0.00\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"6411a311-90d7-4a10-bd7f-0d1138cdb3f0\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":null,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":42,\"eventsCount\":16,\"attendeesCount\":32,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"hot-hikers-club\",\"bio\":\"🌀📚Connecting with roots through routes 🥾🌀\\n\\n\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-31T17:33:10.309Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-04T17:26:51.382Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Rami Haynes-Johnson and Jesse Ghartey\",\"eventsNumber\":12,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/3e93edef-e5b2-4f81-8151-b9f44a0994bb/0673f327-bdec-4359-b26b-bf73e99307f8.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/founders%2F3e93edef-e5b2-4f81-8151-b9f44a0994bb%2F0673f327-bdec-4359-b26b-bf73e99307f8.webp\"}},\"isPrivate\":false,\"isShownPreviewImagesPopup\":true,\"previewImages\":[{\"filePath\":\"companies/7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450/preview/620a0de8-437e-4c6e-be5d-2db007cbe255.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fpreview%2F620a0de8-437e-4c6e-be5d-2db007cbe255.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450/preview/94fab3b4-afac-47d6-b1a5-033084e121c2.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fpreview%2F94fab3b4-afac-47d6-b1a5-033084e121c2.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450/preview/c57a8665-2dc9-48e5-8fdb-3881172cdda8.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fpreview%2Fc57a8665-2dc9-48e5-8fdb-3881172cdda8.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450/preview/f3c87bf6-f5ff-4cd6-8de0-e77684408495.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2F7e1fe5a9-3f44-4ec9-b31c-c019951d7450%2Fpreview%2Ff3c87bf6-f5ff-4cd6-8