          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a\",\"target\":\"event\",\"eventType\":\"manual\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"isTransferEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Mario Kart Tuesdays\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Sonderhaus Mario Kart Nights🏁</strong><br></p><p>Every Tuesday at Sevente, we host a community-led Mario Kart night built around play, competition and connection. Players are randomly seeded into a knockout tournament bracket, with races projected live as competitors battle through each round for the win and a prize at the end of the night.<br></p><p>But it’s always been bigger than just the tournament. People come to race, watch, meet new faces, catch up with friends, have drinks and enjoy the atmosphere. It’s a relaxed social space where gaming becomes a reason to connect.<br></p><p>Alongside the tournament, we occasionally introduce DJs, special formats, live performances, giveaways and collaborations to keep each edition fresh while staying true to the spirit of the night.</p><p>Whether you’re competitive or just looking for a good Tuesday night out, there’s a place for you in the room.<br></p><p>• Every Tuesday</p><p>• Sevente, 283 Hackney Rd, E2 8NA</p><p>• Doors 6PM</p>\",\"salesStartDate\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-09-29T18:00:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-29T22:30:00.000\",\"isPromoCodeAvailable\":false,\"location\":{\"id\":\"033b44c7-53ea-4674-810c-9684eec93e94\",\"address\":\"283 Hackney Road, London, UK\",\"locationName\":\"Sevente\",\"latitude\":51.5312303,\"longitude\":-0.06780209999999999},\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"events/1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a/43255e30-3122-462c-ab71-1fb2b0a4bedb/192dab7c-ae95-4a35-8742-b3152e6dc176.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/events%2F1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a%2F43255e30-3122-462c-ab71-1fb2b0a4bedb%2F192dab7c-ae95-4a35-8742-b3152e6dc176.webp\"},\"programId\":null,\"program\":null,\"tiers\":[{\"id\":\"401fd37c-6093-43fa-8ffc-5af6e40af103\",\"name\":\"Single Admission\",\"description\":\"Access to the tournament, a chance to win the prize of the night, music, good company, and a relaxed social atmosphere built around play and connection. Tournaments begin at 7:30 PM sharp, so make sure to arrive before then if you want to take part.\",\"maxQuantity\":null,\"sold\":3,\"leftSeats\":false,\"startDate\":\"2026-08-19T14:47:00.000\",\"endDate\":\"2026-09-29T19:00:00.000\",\"price\":\"6.20\",\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"isPrivate\":false,\"eventId\":\"1dde7867-125b-43df-9071-245eb3a38c8a\",\"programId\":null}],\"seats\":40,\"isLiked\":false,\"url\":null,\"checkInEnabled\":false,\"company\":{\"followersCount\":311,\"eventsCount\":55,\"attendeesCount\":1564,\"isFollowed\":false,\"isFollowRequested\":false,\"slug\":\"sonderhaus-cic\",\"bio\":\"A creative London community hosting art nights, cultural experiences, and social events for people who want connection, expression, and good energy.\",\"type\":\"community\",\"status\":\"active\",\"stripeConnectOnboardingStatus\":\"onboarded\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-27T11:44:29.092Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-30T16:03:04.957Z\",\"active\":true,\"url\":null,\"founder\":{\"name\":\"Peter Ajuchi\",\"eventsNumber\":0,\"image\":{\"filePath\":\"founders/3d6b9af8-5d1c-4c90-9132-c3182ca1ebce/90ea0e8e-ff1f-46ce-a983-2f906896ea07.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/founders%2F3d6b9af8-5d1c-4c90-9132-c3182ca1ebce%2F90ea0e8e-ff1f-46ce-a983-2f906896ea07.webp\"}},\"isPrivate\":false,\"isShownPreviewImagesPopup\":true,\"previewImages\":[{\"filePath\":\"companies/cca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca/preview/f7f18a48-b55d-463f-873f-1bd2c3eacc7e.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/clyx-production-bucket/companies%2Fcca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca%2Fpreview%2Ff7f18a48-b55d-463f-873f-1bd2c3eacc7e.webp\"},{\"filePath\":\"companies/cca88a24-0acf-4be9-8b8b-3794ad34d6ca/preview/c8b8ef2e-38cb-4347-b7db-6ba39ca1a24b.webp\",\"url\":\"https://storage.google